# The portable package's SHA-256 is part of the release record (RELEASE.md), so
# every file that ends up inside it has to check out byte-identically on every
# machine. This repo has core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise rewrite the
# sources on checkout and silently change the published hash.
*.py   text eol=lf
*.bat  text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=lf
*.png  binary
